### API remains available even when the Go services are stopped.
GET http://localhost:8080/

### With Go serving: 200. With catalog stopped: 502 within the configured deadline.
GET http://localhost:8080/pokemon/pikachu

### Domain validation / not found
GET http://localhost:8080/pokemon/pokemon-that-does-not-exist

### With Go serving: defensive coverage and recommended types.
POST http://localhost:8080/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{"pokemons":[{"id":25,"name":"pikachu","types":[{"type":{"name":"electric"}}]}]}

### Candidates
POST http://localhost:8080/recommendations/pokemon
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"flying","pokemons":[{"id":25,"name":"pikachu","types":[{"type":{"name":"electric"}}]}]}
